@host = http://localhost:5099

### Which cows should I look at today? (herd-wide check)
GET {{host}}/api/alerts/yield-drops

### Same check for a specific day
GET {{host}}/api/alerts/yield-drops?date=2026-10-12

### List the herd
GET {{host}}/api/cows

### Why was one cow judged the way she was? (shows litres, baseline and drop %)
GET {{host}}/api/cows/1/yield-check

### Add a cow
POST {{host}}/api/cows
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tagNumber": "0107",
  "name": "Pearl"
}

### Record a milking (Period is "Morning" or "Evening")
POST {{host}}/api/cows/1/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-10-11",
  "period": "Morning",
  "litres": 13.2
}

### Read a cow's milkings (defaults to the last 14 days)
GET {{host}}/api/cows/1/sessions

### Mark a cow inactive (sold or culled): she is left out of the alerts
PUT {{host}}/api/cows/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Daisy",
  "isActive": false
}
